## Version 1.1.1

- Restores the main window's size and on-screen position after closing and reopening.
- Remembers an independently resized window for each Compact, Statistics and Full layout.
- Changes the default window sizes to Compact 550x102, Statistics 650x157 and Full 650x407.
- Replaces window size presets with 50%, 75%, and 100% of each layout's base size.
- Scales the Compact and Statistics overlay text for smaller window sizes.
- Renames the Style tab to Skins in English and Spanish.
- Adds empty Nomenclature and Skin dropdowns for future customization.

## Version 1.1

- Clears stale Etterna bridge state on startup so the previous chart is not shown.
- Remembers the last selected layout.
- Adds Small / Medium / Large preset window sizes in Options. (WIP)
- Text automatically shrinks when the window is too narrow.
- The strain graph keeps updating even when is not visible in the current layout.
- New Style tab in options (empty for now).
- The Options window is resizable, remembers its last size, and the text scales with the window.
- Keybinds are focus-only by default, with a new option to behave as it did in version 1.0.


## Version 1.0

- Release :D
